            "review_title": "Review at Kiraku Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "alia M\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nA good Japanese restaurant (open until 2 AM)\nJun 2015 • Friends\nI went there yesterday. It is a big restaurant with many rooms for customers from 2 people to 30 people. I am very happy because it opens until 2 AM so we can go there after leaving from bar.\nFood here good, fresh sashimi, very good grills and rice. Price from 1$ - 6$ for a dish. Oke right?\nMust try.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 2, 2015",
